# Bot2's Duress puts Fireblast in Bot1's graveyard. On turn 3 Yawgmoth's Will (paid with Black Lotus) lets Bot1 cast it from there,
# sacrificing its two Mountains rather than paying {4}{R}{R}: Bot2 takes 4.

[Bot1 Deck]
Fireblast
Black Lotus
Yawgmoth's Will
Mountain x4
Mountain x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp
Duress
Swamp x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Duress.Cast(Bot1)
Bot2.Choose(Fireblast)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Yawgmoth's Will.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Graveyard.Fireblast.Cast(Bot2; Ability: Sacrifice)
Bot1.Choose(Mountain; Mountain)
[T3 Bot1.End]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 16
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 0
Stack.Count = 0
